  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Immediately after you cast Rune Strike, you can expend one use of your Channel Divinity to gain one of the following benefits, depending on the rune inscribed on your weapon.</p><p><strong>Blood.</strong> You regain Hit Points equal to the Necrotic damage dealt by your Rune Strike.</p><p><strong>Frost.</strong> Frost covers your weapon and shatters on impact: the target of your Rune Strike and each enemy in a 10-foot Emanation originating from it take 2d6 Cold damage.</p><p><strong>Unholy.</strong> The target of your Rune Strike is cursed until the end of your next turn: the next time it makes a saving throw, it subtracts 1d6 from the roll, and the curse ends.</p>",
      "chat": ""
    },
